 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Flat file store keyed by name. addFile(name,size) succeeds unless the name already exists. copyFile(from,to) succeeds only if from is an existing file and to does not exist; the copy has the same size. getFilesize returns the size or -1. Names are opaque strings; a directory-like name that is not itself a stored file cannot be copied.",
